              "content": "Hint :",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " To pick up the first potato and the second potato, the total distance (in metres) run by a competitor is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2 \\times 5 + 2 \\times (5 + 3)"
